usage: k58-mcf.sh [-h] {prepare,run,toy-proof} ...

Explicit opt-in configurable maximal-colour CNF generation and balanced
CaDiCaL195 runs. Never a stock finalise path.

positional arguments:
  {prepare,run,toy-proof}
    prepare             regenerate exact frozen parent+cube, then append raw
                        MCF
    run                 balanced exact parent/raw-arm conflict-capped
                        comparison
    toy-proof           positive toy UNSAT/replay and negative proof controls

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
